### 1. Maak categorieën aan
POST http://localhost:8080/api/categories
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "categoryName": "Food",
  "categoryDescription": "Restaurant meals, groceries, snacks"
}

### 2. Meer categorieën
POST http://localhost:8080/api/categories
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "categoryName": "Transport",
  "categoryDescription": "Flights, trains, taxis, car rental"
}

### 3.
POST http://localhost:8080/api/categories
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "categoryName": "Accommodation",
  "categoryDescription": "Hotels, hostels, Airbnb"
}

### 4. Haal alle categorieën op
GET http://localhost:8080/api/categories

### 5. Alleen actieve categorieën
GET http://localhost:8080/api/categories/active

### 6. Specifieke categorie
GET http://localhost:8080/api/categories/1

### 7. Update categorie
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/categories/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "categoryName": "Food & Drinks",
  "categoryDescription": "Restaurant meals, groceries, snacks, beverages",
  "isActive": true
}

### 8. Soft delete (deactiveer)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/categories/2

### 9. Hard delete (permanent)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/categories/3/hard

### 10. Check actieve categorieën na delete
GET http://localhost:8080/api/categories/active